    "# Week 7 Assignment\n",
    "## Incremental Data Processing using Delta Lake\n",
    "\n",
    "### Celebal Technologies – Data Engineering Internship\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "The objective of this assignment is to implement an incremental data processing pipeline using Delta Lake.\n",
    "\n",
    "The workflow includes:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Loading a customer master dataset into a Delta Table\n",
    "- Performing data cleaning\n",
    "- Simulating daily incoming customer data\n",
    "- Applying Delta Lake MERGE operations\n",
    "- Validating the final dataset\n",
    "- Demonstrating production-style ETL processing\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Technologies Used\n",
    "\n",
    "- Apache Spark\n",
    "- PySpark\n",
    "- Delta Lake\n",
    "- Databricks\n",
    "- Python\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "- Customer Master Dataset\n",
    "- Customer Incremental Dataset"
   ]
