   "source": [
    "# Business Scenario\n",
    "\n",
    "Imagine an e-commerce company that maintains a centralized **Customer Master Table**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Every day:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Existing customers update their profile information.\n",
    "- New customers register on the platform.\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead of recreating the entire customer table every day, the company processes **only the incremental changes**.\n",
    "\n",
    "This approach:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Reduces processing time\n",
    "- Minimizes storage usage\n",
    "- Improves performance\n",
    "- Preserves data consistency\n",
    "\n",
    "To achieve this, Delta Lake provides the **MERGE** operation, which updates existing records and inserts new records in a single transaction.\n",
    "\n",
    "This assignment simulates the same production workflow using a Customer Master Dataset and an Incremental Customer Dataset."
   ]
