    "Data Profiling helps identify potential issues such as:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Missing values\n",
    "- Duplicate records\n",
    "- Incorrect data types\n",
    "- Unexpected values\n",
    "- Dataset dimensions\n",
    "\n",
    "Performing these checks before data cleaning ensures that only high-quality data is loaded into the Delta Table.\n",
    "\n",
    "This is a standard practice followed in production ETL pipelines."
