    "# Step 3: Create Delta Table\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "After profiling the dataset, the Customer Master DataFrame is loaded into a Delta Table.\n",
    "\n",
    "Delta Lake extends traditional data lakes by providing features such as:\n",
    "\n",
    "- ACID Transactions\n",
    "- Schema Enforcement\n",
    "- Schema Evolution\n",
    "- Time Travel\n",
    "- MERGE Operations\n",
    "- Versioning\n",
    "\n",
    "Creating a Delta Table at this stage establishes the foundation for performing incremental updates in the later stages of the assignment.\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Production Insight:**  \n",
    "> In modern Data Engineering pipelines, Delta Tables serve as the storage layer for reliable and scalable data processing. They enable efficient updates and maintain transactional consistency without rewriting the complete dataset."
   ]
  },
