   "source": [
    "# Step 5: Creating an Incremental Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "In production systems, data does not arrive as a complete dataset every day.\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead, only new records and modified records are received from operational systems.\n",
    "\n",
    "This process is known as **Incremental Data Processing**.\n",
    "\n",
    "To simulate a real-world ETL pipeline, an incremental dataset is created containing:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Existing customers with updated information\n",
    "- New customers who do not exist in the Customer Master table\n",
    "\n",
    "This dataset will later be merged into the Delta Table using Delta Lake MERGE."
   ]
