    "## Business Scenario\n",
    "\n",
    "Assume an e-commerce company maintains a Customer Master table.\n",
    "\n",
    "At the end of every day:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Existing customers may update their city, phone number, or loyalty tier.\n",
    "- New customers may register on the platform.\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead of reloading the complete customer database, only the daily changes are processed.\n",
    "\n",
    "This significantly reduces processing time and is the standard approach followed in modern Data Engineering pipelines."
