   "source": [
    "After creating a trusted Customer Master Delta Table, the next step is to simulate the arrival of new customer data.\n",
    "\n",
    "In production environments, organizations do not reload the complete customer master every day. Instead, only the newly arrived records and modified customer information are processed.\n",
    "\n",
    "This approach is known as **Incremental Data Processing**, which significantly reduces processing time, storage requirements, and computational cost.\n",
    "\n",
    "For this assignment, an incremental dataset is created programmatically to simulate daily customer updates.\n",
    "\n",
    "The generated dataset contains:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Existing customers whose information has changed (UPDATE)\n",
    "- New customers who have recently registered (INSERT)\n",
    "\n",
    "This dataset will later be merged into the Delta Table using Delta Lake MERGE operations."
   ]
