    "\n",
    "Assume today is **Day 2**.\n",
    "\n",
    "The company already has a Customer Master table created on **Day 1**.\n",
    "\n",
    "During the day:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Some customers updated their personal information.\n",
    "- Some customers became premium members.\n",
    "- Some customers placed more orders.\n",
    "- New customers registered on the platform.\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead of processing all customer records again, only these changes are received from the CRM system.\n",
    "\n",
    "This incoming dataset is called the **Incremental Dataset**."
