    "## Production Insight\n",
    "\n",
    "In real-world Customer Relationship Management (CRM) systems, customers frequently update information such as:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Address\n",
    "- Email\n",
    "- Loyalty Status\n",
    "- Purchase History\n",
    "- Membership Tier\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead of recreating the complete customer database, only these modified records are sent to the Data Engineering pipeline.\n",
    "\n",
    "This significantly reduces storage, processing time, and infrastructure cost."
   ]
