   "source": [
    "# Step 6 : Slowly Changing Dimension Type 1 (SCD Type 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "After preparing the incremental dataset, the next step is to merge it into the Customer Master Delta Table.\n",
    "\n",
    "This merge operation follows the **Slowly Changing Dimension Type 1 (SCD Type 1)** approach.\n",
    "\n",
    "In SCD Type 1:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Existing records are updated with the latest information.\n",
    "- New records are inserted.\n",
    "- Previous values are overwritten.\n",
    "- Historical information is **not preserved**.\n",
    "\n",
    "This strategy is commonly used when only the latest customer information is required."
   ]
  },
