   "source": [
    "## Business Scenario\n",
    "\n",
    "Assume an online retail company maintains a Customer Master table.\n",
    "\n",
    "Every day:\n",
    "\n",
    "• Existing customers may update their city, email, or loyalty status.\n",
    "\n",
    "• New customers register on the platform.\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead of replacing the entire Customer Master table, Delta Lake MERGE intelligently:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Updates existing customers.\n",
    "- Inserts new customers.\n",
    "\n",
    "This makes the ETL pipeline efficient and scalable."
   ]
