   "source": [
    "## How MERGE Works\n",
    "\n",
    "Delta Lake compares records using the business key (`customer_id`).\n",
    "\n",
    "- If the customer already exists, the existing record is updated with the latest values.\n",
    "- If the customer does not exist, a new record is inserted.\n",
    "\n",
    "Unlike traditional ETL pipelines that reload the entire dataset, MERGE processes only the changed records, making incremental pipelines significantly more efficient."
   ]
