   "source": [
    "## Business Scenario\n",
    "\n",
    "Suppose customer **U1015** changes their city from **Guwahati** to **Bangalore**.\n",
    "\n",
    "In SCD Type 1:\n",
    "- The old city is overwritten.\n",
    "\n",
    "In SCD Type 2:\n",
    "- The old record remains in the table for historical reference.\n",
    "- A new record with the updated city is added.\n",
    "- Only the latest record is marked as current.\n",
    "\n",
    "This enables organizations to answer historical questions such as:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Where did the customer live last year?\n",
    "- What was the customer's previous loyalty tier?\n",
    "- When did the customer change their address?"
   ]
